            "author": {
              "name": "Vet",
              "handle": "Vet_X0",
              "avatarUrl": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2074523223484452864/QrEIGvC1_normal.jpg",
              "isVerified": false
            },
            "content": "\"we bring the same principles of the equity world to digital assets\"\n\nNative assets of public permissionless decentralized networks are commodities, not equities.\n\nThey exclude Bitcoin while keeping ETH/Solana? Do they not know that PoS and PoW are very similar in the principles they are trying to measure?\n\nThe index composition makes no sense and imo is the scary truth, that institutions in this space struggle hard to 1) understand it 2) how to value it.\n\nProtocol revenue here is literally the friction between users and forced stakeholders like miners and validators. The more revenue a protocol earns the more it took away from users to use a network.\n\nIt's bizarre how this makes sense for an open protocol, it makes absolutely sense for a business and thus equities.\n\nThe XRP Ledger says, hey its super cheap to make forward progress if just agree on it, no friction no revenue.\n\nWe are so ahead in our understanding of this space it's not even remotely funny.",
            "createdAt": "Tue Jul 21 23:41:28 +0000 2026",
            "viewCount": 11121,
            "metrics": {
              "views": 11121,
              "likes": 192,
              "retweets": 33,
              "replies": 10,
              "quotes": 1,
              "bookmarks": 17
            },
            "media": [
              "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HNygSPrXkAAJNgF.jpg"
            ],
            "translation": {
              "provider": "google",
              "status": "success",
              "language": "zh-CN",
              "text": "“我们将股权世界的相同原则引入数字资产”\n\n公共无需许可的去中心化网络的原生资产是商品，而不是股票。\n\n他们排除比特币而保留 ETH/Solana？难道他们不知道 PoS 和 PoW 在他们试图衡量的原理上非常相似吗？\n\n该指数的构成毫无意义，在我看来，这是一个可怕的事实，这个领域的机构很难 1) 理解它 2) 如何对其进行估值。\n\n这里的协议收入实际上是用户与矿工和验证者等被迫利益相关者之间的摩擦。协议赚取的收入越多，从用户使用网络中获取的收入就越多。\n\n奇怪的是，这对于开放协议来说是有意义的，但对于企业和股票来说却绝对有意义。\n\nXRP Ledger 说，嘿，如果只是同意的话，取得进展的成本超级低，没有摩擦就没有收入。\n\n我们对这个领域的理解如此领先，这一点也不好笑。",
              "annotations": [],
              "error": "",
              "updatedAt": "2026-07-22T01:58:50.245Z",
              "version": 1
            }
          },
